    "detailed_description": "<strong>Spicy Fruit</strong> is a physics-based puzzle game! Drop cute fruit! Combine matching fruit to evolve to the next fruit! Feed them chili peppers to set them ablaze for more points! When you combine 2 chili peppers, things get even crazier! But, be careful not to overfill the container!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Tips</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Achieve multiple fruit merges from a single drop to increase the <strong>combo multiplier</strong>!<br></li><li>Combine 2 chili peppers to make a <strong>super pepper</strong>! When a fruit eats a <strong>super pepper</strong>, it becomes a <strong>super fruit</strong>!<br></li><li><strong>Super fruit</strong> eat chili peppers to evolve to the next fruit! And, they eat smaller burning fruit for <strong>more points</strong> when they explode from a full stomach!</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Leaderboard</h2>Have your high score placed on the <strong>global leaderboard</strong>!",
